    {
      "id": "garden_01",
      "text": "Welcome to LogicGarden. I’m Lefyahj, your guide.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=d37e88f7-24da-4038-85e0-0a89c9b5e480.mp3",
      "duration": 3.996734693877551
    },
    {
      "id": "garden_02",
      "text": "This is a safe realm where you can prepare for your journey through Discrete Mathematics.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=36853683-85d6-4c97-bc54-51ad6316491b.mp3",
      "duration": 5.015510204081632,
      "request": "d8a51aeb461f4ad1b251abda1e6e6796"
    },
    {
      "id": "garden_03",
      "text": "The Logic Library holds the topics you’ll explore, from prelims through finals.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=a01e8412-6655-463a-aa9f-c5a0008e2da4.mp3",
      "duration": 5.328979591836735,
      "request": "a8494ab12bb44ce0aad879e55b641eae"
    },
    {
      "id": "garden_04",
      "text": "Visit the library to learn about these topics and prepare for the challenges ahead.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=4a5fe5be-f82d-4cfb-a845-10f75a2e5fe1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.858775510204081,
      "request": "8ab05de8cd3c4f8189e7c7da42af2c99"
    },
    {
      "id": "garden_05",
      "text": "The entrance is now open. Head to the Logic Library when you’re ready.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=edb2ba27-bc36-40d5-b590-bcc2bfa43cd4.mp3",
      "duration": 4.54530612244898,
      "request": "40050dc849af4f3c9a47764e9264b695"
    },
    {
      "id": "library_01",
      "text": "Welcome to the Logic Library.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=e5d7b866-b8ae-4d15-abe1-5a49f7e230bd.mp3",
      "duration": 2.4293877551020406,
      "request": "744851a62f6c4494846f615353172e34"
    },
    {
      "id": "library_02",
      "text": "Here, you can explore Discrete Mathematics topics from prelims through finals.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=5d86aa3d-0b0e-496b-856f-de33c16bebda.mp3",
      "duration": 5.015510204081632,
      "request": "f72e6f6ad44d4a19b01e5ca1a050fb24"
    },
    {
      "id": "library_03",
      "text": "Approach a shelf and tap the hand button. Choose a topic to open its book.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=f20687c3-7105-4311-8523-160e86244a69.mp3",
      "duration": 5.146122448979592,
      "request": "2ba3d0f59a544d04be41e18ed90a6fc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "library_04",
      "text": "Take your time learning. You can return to LogicGarden whenever you’re ready.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=b6cb1375-b371-48aa-a31d-593b2c21af57.mp3",
      "duration": 4.597551020408163,
      "request": "6d8cf29d0d7a4d26b0223346830f724e"
    },
    {
      "id": "tour_prelim",
      "text": "PRELIM covers propositional logic, truth tables, and rules of inference. These books explain propositions, logical connectives, truth values, and valid arguments.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=ef5891a0-fc31-4ec5-b6ec-745c2ef97b8e.mp3",
      "duration": 11.23265306122449,
      "request": "30d315d65ba4499c8af7d278251da935"
    },
    {
      "id": "tour_midterms",
      "text": "MIDTERMS covers formal and informal proofs, followed by direct and indirect proofs. Learn how to structure a proof and use deduction, contradiction, and the contrapositive.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=aeafbf63-b184-48a1-a66f-529c67e4f550.mp3",
      "duration": 11.67673469387755,
      "request": "43aee75fd33542a1b7fa78bb4b268dae"
    },
    {
      "id": "tour_prefinals",
      "text": "PRE-FINALS contains mathematical induction, sets, and functions and relations. Explore induction proofs, set operations and complements, ordered pairs, and mappings.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=4479c200-fe06-4afa-b7a9-03f1e5cbc3d0.mp3",
      "duration": 11.911836734693878,
      "request": "091e5cde46224828b252d689dc345a41"
    },
    {
      "id": "tour_finals",
      "text": "FINALS introduces graphs and trees. Learn about vertices, edges, degree, paths and cycles, then explore tree terminology, tree types, and spanning trees.",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=5ba189c8-2e01-4c3b-8355-20fccae995d3.mp3",
      "duration": 11.10204081632653,
      "request": "74c3cfd4e3c0482fa73ecf5bd0a27ae6"
    },
    {
      "id": "tour_confirm",
      "text": "Did you get all that?",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/90935a12740349979ef37487d2a83eb4/36f8b43f8cb24db58ae6d77f0f9fc98e/id=c5c8a434-3651-4f95-ba94-7b1edd6f6b06.mp3",
      "duration": 1.5673469387755101,
